WEBVTT

00:00:01.451 --> 00:00:09.879
The lonesome three.

00:00:11.868 --> 00:00:18.387
Mr. Albert rescued Candy who fell
down the waterfall and nearly drowned.

00:00:19.334 --> 00:00:24.103
He said; whenever you're sad or hurt,
put a letter into a bottle...

00:00:24.138 --> 00:00:25.868
...and let it flow down this river.

00:00:26.465 --> 00:00:32.287
To Candy, mr. Albert was a total stranger.

00:00:33.604 --> 00:00:42.352
The image of kind, bearded mr. Albert
burned itself deeply into Candy's heart.

00:00:45.027 --> 00:00:50.444
At that time, owing to the hard
work of Anthony, a new kind of rose...

00:00:50.479 --> 00:00:55.377
...began to bloom beautifully in
the Adley' family garden.

00:00:57.211 --> 00:01:04.661
Anthony gave Candy's name to the new rose.
He named it "Sweet Candy".

00:01:14.742 --> 00:01:16.209
Sweet Candy.

00:01:16.647 --> 00:01:19.434
It's sweet and pretty just like me,
right, Kurin?

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:25.084
Anthony worked so many years for this,
and finally it bloomed.

00:01:25.128 --> 00:01:29.845
Of course, it's the only one of
its kind in the whole world!

00:01:37.541 --> 00:01:42.000
Anthony named that rose after Candy...

00:01:42.531 --> 00:01:45.985
What happened to him, to go crazy
over that barn-dwelling girl...

00:01:46.316 --> 00:01:48.553
He's not the only one.

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:52.549
Stear, Archie and everyone else in the
house is all "Candy, Candy..."

00:01:53.451 --> 00:01:56.399
The next thing will be us Leagans
looking up to Candy!

00:01:56.603 --> 00:01:59.960
To such a girl?
I'm not going to put up with that!

00:02:00.287 --> 00:02:01.969
Do something, Brother!

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:03.679
And I will.

00:02:05.036 --> 00:02:06.614
Have any good ideas?

00:02:06.649 --> 00:02:08.051
I'm thinking about poisoning.

00:02:08.457 --> 00:02:09.478
Candy?!

00:02:09.591 --> 00:02:11.350
Stupid, not her.

00:02:11.765 --> 00:02:13.214
Not her?

00:02:13.444 --> 00:02:15.793
I'll poison horses in the barn.

00:02:19.586 --> 00:02:22.758
If you don't spread the dough like this,
you can't make a tasty pie.

00:02:22.873 --> 00:02:26.437
That's right.
It's the hard part of the lesson!

00:02:30.557 --> 00:02:33.041
Brother, do it now!
Candy is in the kitchen!

00:02:33.076 --> 00:02:33.934
Alright.

00:02:40.534 --> 00:02:42.738
I'll let horses drink a bit of this.

00:02:42.841 --> 00:02:44.026
Won't it kill them?

00:02:44.449 --> 00:02:46.727
It'll get them pretty sick!

00:02:48.491 --> 00:02:50.617
Now, eat up, Caesar!

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:55.371
Huh?

00:03:05.768 --> 00:03:06.964
That's...

00:03:08.982 --> 00:03:10.775
Something must have happened.

00:03:14.077 --> 00:03:15.263
Neil!

00:03:17.495 --> 00:03:20.527
Neil, what's wrong!
Hang in there, Neil!

00:03:20.812 --> 00:03:24.507
Eliza, calm down, it's me, Candy!
What happened?

00:03:27.144 --> 00:03:29.816
Somebody! Somebody come!
Brother was...!

00:03:30.118 --> 00:03:33.784
Neil, pull yourself together!
Neil!

00:03:34.147 --> 00:03:38.716
-Miss Eliza! What happened?
-Miss! What's wrong?

00:03:38.751 --> 00:03:39.924
Brother was...!

00:03:41.459 --> 00:03:42.563
Mr. Neil!

00:03:43.614 --> 00:03:44.590
Quickly!

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:45.820
Mr. Neil!

00:03:45.877 --> 00:03:48.936
Don't worry. He's just unconscious.

00:03:49.052 --> 00:03:51.773
Mr. Neil? Just who did this to you?

00:03:54.355 --> 00:03:56.938
It was Candy!
She did it!

00:03:58.246 --> 00:03:59.496
Eliza?

00:04:01.479 --> 00:04:03.261
Candy did this?

00:04:07.497 --> 00:04:09.014
But this is...

00:04:09.251 --> 00:04:12.421
Candy wanted to give this to the horses!

00:04:12.456 --> 00:04:14.558
Eliza! Don't tell such nonsense!

00:04:14.644 --> 00:04:16.426
You're calling this nonsense?

00:04:16.609 --> 00:04:20.348
When Brother tried to stop her,
she hit him!

00:04:20.853 --> 00:04:23.934
What a violent person!
I'm shocked!

00:04:23.969 --> 00:04:28.050
But... Neil was already on the
ground when I came in here!

00:04:28.085 --> 00:04:31.185
You're calling Miss Eliza a liar now?

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:35.081
I saw everything. A tall man was
fleeing from the barn!

00:04:35.116 --> 00:04:38.476
That's right, Candy.
Blame others again!

00:04:38.754 --> 00:04:42.611
I'm telling the truth!
You saw it, too!

00:04:43.165 --> 00:04:46.091
I saw nobody running from the barn!

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.780
This swelling is turning into
a nasty eyepatch.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:52.489
Candy did it.

00:04:52.691 --> 00:04:58.706
This is a pretty nasty wound.
Such a tiny girl would hardly...

00:04:58.741 --> 00:05:01.477
Hoittman! Are you calling Miss a liar?

00:05:01.512 --> 00:05:04.674
Uh, no! I wasn't really...

00:05:05.778 --> 00:05:08.209
Anyway, let's carry mr. Neil to his room.

00:05:08.575 --> 00:05:10.423
-Yes.
-Now, hurry up!

00:05:16.758 --> 00:05:17.552
It hurts!

00:05:17.553 --> 00:05:18.868
Poor boy!

00:05:19.291 --> 00:05:21.890
Who would be so horrible to such a
gentle child?

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.201
Brother, hang in there!

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:27.248
Get well quickly, mr. Neil.

00:05:27.899 --> 00:05:30.589
-It hurts me, mama!
-My poor boy...

00:05:31.959 --> 00:05:35.984
"Get well quickly", huh?
And he just got an eyepatch.

00:05:36.013 --> 00:05:40.066
It seems that he doesn't know that
one can't fight without getting hurt.

00:05:40.101 --> 00:05:44.911
That's right! I was hurt in fights
so many times ever since I was a kid.

00:05:45.166 --> 00:05:48.582
Doug, Dorothy, do you too think
that I did that?

00:05:48.687 --> 00:05:52.249
If it wasn't yours, maybe it
was God's doing!

00:05:52.284 --> 00:05:53.323
God's doing?

00:05:54.116 --> 00:05:55.694
A divine punishment!

00:05:57.524 --> 00:06:00.741
Candy!
Get in here!

00:06:01.931 --> 00:06:02.936
Yes.

00:06:03.558 --> 00:06:06.920
Poor girl.
She's gonna get chewed out again.

00:06:07.159 --> 00:06:11.724
Candy.
Let's hear the truth from Neil himself.

00:06:12.083 --> 00:06:14.702
We'll know for sure once he tells us.

00:06:21.219 --> 00:06:24.513
It hurts!
My poor boy!

00:06:24.548 --> 00:06:30.074
Well? Who hit you then? Okay?
You only need to tell me that.

00:06:30.332 --> 00:06:31.958
It was...

00:06:32.344 --> 00:06:35.495
Brother, Candy did it!

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:36.795
Wait!

00:06:38.856 --> 00:06:39.897
Neil!

00:06:40.344 --> 00:06:43.395
He's "mister Neil" to you!

00:06:43.849 --> 00:06:47.423
Mr. Neil. You're a man, right?

00:06:51.429 --> 00:06:56.661
Are you saying that you, as a man, allowed
yourself to be punched and hurt by a girl?

00:06:57.052 --> 00:07:00.500
If that's true, you're not much of a man!

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:07.701
If that's true, wouldn't that be a
disgrace to the Leagan family?

00:07:08.124 --> 00:07:11.128
Candy!
Are you threatening him?

00:07:11.163 --> 00:07:15.854
I just want Neil.. no, mr. Neil
to tell us the truth.

00:07:17.487 --> 00:07:21.497
Tell me now. Don't concern yourself
with what Candy said.

00:07:21.532 --> 00:07:23.572
Tell me the truth, Neil!

00:07:23.607 --> 00:07:25.462
The truth.

00:07:27.317 --> 00:07:28.873
Brother!

00:07:29.276 --> 00:07:30.357
Neil!

00:07:31.658 --> 00:07:32.866
Brother!

00:07:36.662 --> 00:07:39.159
It was... Ca..

00:07:39.194 --> 00:07:40.972
Candy did it!

00:07:47.109 --> 00:07:51.427
Neil, I saw everthing.
The fleeing dark shadow.

00:07:55.018 --> 00:07:57.266
A tall man with long hair...

00:08:00.843 --> 00:08:02.436
Then, it was...!

00:08:06.354 --> 00:08:08.838
So that's how it was.

00:08:09.117 --> 00:08:12.996
What? What's up with that happy face?

00:08:14.162 --> 00:08:17.931
I'll go look for the man
who punched Neil!

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:20.225
Candy!

00:08:22.865 --> 00:08:25.050
I'm sure it was mr. Albert.

00:08:27.158 --> 00:08:31.161
If I put this letter into a bottle, and let it
flow downstream... it will reach mr. Albert.

00:08:31.162 --> 00:08:34.191
Candy, If something bad ever happens to you,
you can write me a letter.

00:08:34.226 --> 00:08:38.947
Put it in a bottle and allow southern winds to
take it. Your note will surely reach me.

00:08:39.461 --> 00:08:41.338
Thank you, mr. Albert!

00:08:47.935 --> 00:08:49.681
The southern wind is blowing.

00:08:51.778 --> 00:08:55.153
Please.. please, reach mr. Albert.

00:09:11.967 --> 00:09:14.027
Kurin, where are you going?
It's dangerous!

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:21.247
That's right, if I wished upon this bottle,
I could at least follow it a little.

00:10:03.212 --> 00:10:06.052
We can't follow it from here on.

00:10:09.256 --> 00:10:11.525
Can't help it then.
I'd better head back.

00:10:20.835 --> 00:10:23.340
The moonlight is disappearing.

00:10:29.426 --> 00:10:32.417
It's dark! What will I do?

00:10:38.976 --> 00:10:41.572
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
Horie Mitsuko, you're the best.

00:10:54.566 --> 00:10:56.701
Good morning.
Candy!

00:11:01.319 --> 00:11:02.993
Mr. Albert!

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:06.437
I got your note.
Anyway, let's go to my place.

00:11:06.773 --> 00:11:07.600
Yes.

00:11:17.434 --> 00:11:19.789
You're living in such a place...?

00:11:21.057 --> 00:11:22.848
Mr. Albert, is this your house?

00:11:22.883 --> 00:11:23.774
Something like that.

00:11:23.809 --> 00:11:24.666
It's pretty!

00:11:24.701 --> 00:11:28.335
Hey, wait a minute. You need to take a
test before you can enter this house!

00:11:28.336 --> 00:11:29.184
A test?

00:11:30.948 --> 00:11:32.029
You'll know in a moment.

00:11:32.488 --> 00:11:34.736
Hey! We have a guest!

00:11:37.475 --> 00:11:43.148
Wow, so many!

00:11:43.758 --> 00:11:46.083
Kurin, they're your friends!

00:11:46.118 --> 00:11:47.843
It tickles!

00:11:49.543 --> 00:11:50.826
They're cute!

00:11:53.369 --> 00:11:54.624
You're a good boy.

00:11:55.709 --> 00:11:58.954
Alright, you've passed!
And with a maximum score, too!

00:12:06.084 --> 00:12:09.754
Are you living alone in such a big house?

00:12:09.789 --> 00:12:12.278
They are my family.
And there are many of them.

00:12:18.682 --> 00:12:21.517
It was you who punched Neil, right?

00:12:21.552 --> 00:12:25.266
That's right. He was going to
poison innocent animals, and for what?

00:12:32.955 --> 00:12:36.098
However, I'm afraid that I put you in
a lot of trouble by doing that.

00:12:36.522 --> 00:12:39.563
Neil and Eliza were trying to
set me up on purpose.

00:12:39.875 --> 00:12:43.449
I was going to talk to them.
But I didn't.

00:12:43.753 --> 00:12:44.888
Why?

00:12:45.134 --> 00:12:48.013
They were gradually turning you
into a leper of the Leagan family.

00:12:49.647 --> 00:12:53.342
I don't care! I wasn't going
to forgive them, anyway!

00:12:54.028 --> 00:12:55.157
But...

00:12:55.436 --> 00:12:58.681
And those two, they wanted
to have me kicked out all along.

00:12:58.716 --> 00:13:01.185
Do you have a place to stay?

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:02.993
Let me stay here, please!

00:13:03.028 --> 00:13:06.209
I'm good at everything,
and I can even make a pie!

00:13:06.244 --> 00:13:08.042
And I can look after the animals!

00:13:08.447 --> 00:13:10.095
Candy.

00:13:11.108 --> 00:13:15.448
These animals know how to find
food for themselves.

00:13:15.483 --> 00:13:19.043
They had to learn that, or they
would be in trouble when they're alone.

00:13:19.219 --> 00:13:22.034
Is it okay for people to be alone, too?

00:13:22.069 --> 00:13:23.512
I like being alone.

00:13:23.875 --> 00:13:25.854
I thought so ever since I was little.

00:13:26.259 --> 00:13:28.033
You, too?

00:13:28.411 --> 00:13:30.855
Yes. I'm a lone tramp.

00:13:31.035 --> 00:13:32.913
Then, this house...?

00:13:33.108 --> 00:13:35.910
Probably some rich man's villa.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:39.695
Oh, okay, okay.

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:41.430
I'm like that, too!

00:13:42.942 --> 00:13:44.953
Alone and homeless!

00:13:45.632 --> 00:13:47.815
What are you so happy about, then?

00:13:48.742 --> 00:13:53.240
Because it's been a while since I've
met a person who is alone, just like me.

00:13:53.275 --> 00:13:55.926
I see.
So that's it!

00:14:04.132 --> 00:14:05.347
What's going on?

00:14:05.382 --> 00:14:07.663
It seems that it's time for me
to say goodbye to you!

00:14:09.488 --> 00:14:10.714
This way!

00:14:11.644 --> 00:14:13.483
Where are you going, mr. Albert?

00:14:14.366 --> 00:14:17.325
I'm going to help my animals
escape to a safe place.

00:14:17.414 --> 00:14:18.441
I'll go with you!

00:14:18.442 --> 00:14:21.409
Candy, you stay here and hold them off.

00:14:22.510 --> 00:14:23.487
But...

00:14:23.522 --> 00:14:25.643
They won't do anything bad to you.

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:27.017
But...

00:14:27.175 --> 00:14:31.704
Candy, I'll see you soon, for sure.
Stay happy.

00:14:32.059 --> 00:14:34.837
Hang in there. Don't give up!

00:14:35.604 --> 00:14:36.929
Mr. Albert!

00:14:37.955 --> 00:14:39.014
Well then.

00:14:49.851 --> 00:14:51.388
Get out! Slowly!

00:14:55.116 --> 00:14:58.191
Are they going after him because
he did something wrong?

00:14:59.767 --> 00:15:01.320
Get out or we'll shoot you!

00:15:01.913 --> 00:15:04.017
It's not a joke, don't shoot!

00:15:07.646 --> 00:15:08.617
A little girl!

00:15:10.947 --> 00:15:12.122
Are you alone?

00:15:12.157 --> 00:15:13.056
As you can see!

00:15:13.057 --> 00:15:14.713
Where is that man?

00:15:15.531 --> 00:15:17.692
He ran away hours ago!

00:15:17.727 --> 00:15:19.624
Isn't he a friend of yours?

00:15:19.815 --> 00:15:20.725
Not really.

00:15:21.028 --> 00:15:23.378
Hey, we'll going to look for him
around the estate.

00:15:24.252 --> 00:15:26.548
And how did you get inside
the estate?

00:15:27.016 --> 00:15:28.861
Through that entrance.

00:15:28.896 --> 00:15:30.559
Damn...

00:15:32.271 --> 00:15:33.590
This is Adley family property!

00:15:33.591 --> 00:15:34.804
Adley family?

00:15:35.009 --> 00:15:36.832
Anyway, you'll have to come
with us.

00:15:37.433 --> 00:15:41.706
Hey, why are you guys looking
for that man, anyway?

00:15:41.798 --> 00:15:43.488
Because he was trespassing.

00:15:43.717 --> 00:15:45.669
What? Only because of that?

00:15:45.704 --> 00:15:51.844
What do you mean? We are supposed to
shoot all trespassers on this estate.

00:15:55.524 --> 00:15:56.905
Anthony!

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:58.696
Candy!

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:02.050
Mr. Anthony! This girl is
an acquaintance of yours?

00:16:02.085 --> 00:16:04.857
Yes. She's my friend, Candice.

00:16:05.003 --> 00:16:06.573
Oh... alright then!

00:16:16.638 --> 00:16:18.730
So good!

00:16:18.765 --> 00:16:19.877
I'm sorry for that.

00:16:19.912 --> 00:16:21.296
My fault.

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:23.854
No, not at all.

00:16:23.933 --> 00:16:27.504
Candy, you don't have to return
to Leagans anymore.

00:16:28.595 --> 00:16:30.442
What do you mean, Anthony?

00:16:30.717 --> 00:16:33.460
The three of us had
a wonderful discussion.

00:16:34.103 --> 00:16:35.787
A wonderful discussion?

00:16:37.107 --> 00:16:39.413
If you come, I'll show you.

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:44.866
Candy? In the Adley family?

00:16:44.901 --> 00:16:46.300
Yes, aunt.

00:16:46.616 --> 00:16:50.200
Anyway, even though she's a girl,
Candy is violent, rude...

00:16:50.201 --> 00:16:51.365
Archie!

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.149
It's okay!

00:16:52.272 --> 00:16:55.718
And though she's a servant, she's
hardly worthy of the Adley family!

00:16:55.753 --> 00:16:57.102
Anthony, you too?

00:16:57.801 --> 00:17:01.657
I've heard a lot about Candy's
bad behavior.

00:17:02.514 --> 00:17:03.730
But...!

00:17:03.765 --> 00:17:08.693
If this continues, she might
bring bad reputation to the family!

00:17:09.222 --> 00:17:15.514
Thus, great aunt Elroy, our idea was
to have you educate Candy from now on!

00:17:15.921 --> 00:17:17.087
Me?

00:17:17.127 --> 00:17:20.853
There is nobody else that could
educate Candy!

00:17:21.266 --> 00:17:23.642
Why, maybe so...

00:17:24.063 --> 00:17:29.348
If you can turn Candy into a beautiful lady,
people will look up to you even more!

00:17:31.376 --> 00:17:34.620
And you came all the way just to...

00:17:34.907 --> 00:17:37.448
Then, are you okay with Candy
being taken in by this house?

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:41.589
I will be a stern teacher to her!

00:17:41.624 --> 00:17:43.568
-We did it!
-Congratulations, Candy!

00:17:44.878 --> 00:17:46.761
Aunt Elroy?

00:17:49.223 --> 00:17:51.378
Oh? Eliza!

00:17:51.717 --> 00:17:54.082
Don't let yourself be fooled, aunt.

00:17:54.236 --> 00:17:55.495
What do you mean?

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:57.480
Eliza!

00:17:57.654 --> 00:18:01.298
She's the one who snuck into the
mansion with some bum.

00:18:01.333 --> 00:18:03.553
I'm sure you will dearly regret this
decision.

00:18:03.812 --> 00:18:05.101
With a bum?

00:18:05.133 --> 00:18:07.017
I heard this from the guards.

00:18:07.052 --> 00:18:08.865
Candy! Is this true?

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:12.918
It's true that I snuck into the mansion...
but that person wasn't a bum!

00:18:13.259 --> 00:18:15.918
That's right! Mr. Albert is Candy's...

00:18:15.953 --> 00:18:19.373
Anthony! This conversation never happened.

00:18:19.776 --> 00:18:22.430
-Grand aunt!
-Please reconsider this!

00:18:22.667 --> 00:18:25.781
I don't want to deal with such a filthy girl.

00:18:39.167 --> 00:18:42.204
Eliza... just how far will she go?

00:18:42.527 --> 00:18:44.243
It's okay, Anthony.

00:18:45.794 --> 00:18:50.194
As long as you and the others live
in this place, I'll be happy.

00:18:50.229 --> 00:18:51.594
Candy...

00:18:51.672 --> 00:18:56.644
A man who lived alone in that mansion
went on a journey today.

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:03.311
Things were similar with me.

00:19:03.922 --> 00:19:08.166
Candy.. it's the same with me, too.

00:19:08.754 --> 00:19:10.133
Anthony?

00:19:12.145 --> 00:19:16.693
My late mama made this rose garden.

00:19:18.882 --> 00:19:20.944
So that's why Anthony likes roses.

00:19:21.546 --> 00:19:24.404
Mama loved roses very much.

00:19:25.103 --> 00:19:29.191
I too... love roses!

00:19:30.175 --> 00:19:32.108
Candy... want to ride?

00:19:33.047 --> 00:19:34.974
Yes!

00:20:00.979 --> 00:20:02.487
Let's run, Candy!

00:20:02.973 --> 00:20:03.858
Okay.

00:20:03.893 --> 00:20:05.168
Hold on tightly!

00:20:05.835 --> 00:20:10.490
Run!
We won't give in to loneliness!

00:20:10.525 --> 00:20:11.776
We won't give up!

00:20:13.944 --> 00:20:17.797
Candy, relax...
Just don't fall from my arms!

00:20:17.832 --> 00:20:20.492
It's okay.
I'm holding on tightly!

00:20:21.889 --> 00:20:24.271
Anthony...
Anthony!

00:20:24.498 --> 00:20:30.030
Hear the sound of my heart.
It's so... so loud!

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:33.154
This wind against my face...

00:20:33.943 --> 00:20:37.269
Anthony, I'm hearing your voice
with the wind!

00:20:37.797 --> 00:20:38.967
Candy!

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:41.249
I love you!

00:20:42.264 --> 00:20:44.037
I love you!

00:20:45.405 --> 00:20:46.678
Anthony!

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:52.349
I wish the two of us could become the wind,
going somewhere far away.

00:20:55.839 --> 00:21:00.008
I wish this path
would extend to eternity.

00:21:01.050 --> 00:21:03.508
This is what Candy wished for.

00:21:03.708 --> 00:21:08.696
In Anthony's arms,
forever.

00:21:14.854 --> 00:21:20.200
To be continued.
